OL,3,GNEWSAGun found at nursery shut down
OL,4,Aover rat infestation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gun has been found at a nursery which
OL,7,Fwas closed last week over a rat
OL,8,Finfestation.
OL,10,FOfficers made the discovery after
OL,11,Fsearching Mini Fingers nursery on
OL,12,FLiverpool Road in Irlam, Salford, at
OL,13,Fabout 20:30 BST on Wednesday, Greater
OL,14,FManchester Police (GMP) said.
OL,16,FThe nursery had been issued with a
OL,17,Fprohibition order by Salford City
OL,18,FCouncil's environmental health
OL,19,Fdepartment on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
