OL,3,GNEWSAGun found at nursery shut down
OL,4,Aover rat infestation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said it had found a firearm
OL,7,Fand a "substantial quantity" of
OL,8,Fammunition and two men had been
OL,9,Farrested on suspicion of drug offences.
OL,10,FGMP said the investigation was entirely
OL,11,Funrelated to the closure.
